{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning everyone. Nadia Brooks here from Utilization Management. I have authorization information to share regarding one of the three cases under consideration for tonight's rapid whole-genome sequencing run. Before we proceed, I'd like to hear from genetics, laboratory operations, and genetic counseling on their assessments of the Alder, Birch, and Cedar cases, and then I'll provide the payer authorization status I have on file."}
