{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, Nadia. Dr. Ravi Shah here from Clinical Genetics. I'd like to share my assessment of the Alder case. Case Alder involves a medication-selection decision that depends on a rapid whole-genome result, and the clinical team has designated Alder as the clinically actionable priority for this overnight run. I documented this decision in my service note, though I should flag that the note has not yet reached the laboratory queue. I'll formally disclose that detail now so the laboratory has it for their decision-making. I'd like to hear from laboratory operations and genetic counseling on specimen adequacy and consent scope for all three cases before we finalize."}
```

