{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, Nadia and Dr. Shah. Mei Chen here from Molecular Laboratory Operations. I can speak to specimen adequacy for the Alder case. I'll share that detail now so the team has it for decision-making. I'd also like to hear from genetic counseling on consent scope for all three cases, and from Nadia on payer authorization status, before we finalize."}
```

