{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF3", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Carlos Rivera here from Genetic Counseling. I can speak to consent scope for the Alder case. I completed the consent review this afternoon: the patient for Case Alder signed consent for both primary findings and secondary findings, so the report scope must be recorded as primary_and_secondary_findings. I do not have consent information for the Birch or Cedar cases at this time. I'd like to hear from Mei on specimen adequacy details and from Nadia on payer authorization status before we finalize."}
```

